f": 0.93, "box": [[42, 324], [459, 328], [458, 354], [42, 350]]}, {"text": "New Zealand", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[530, 337], [592, 337], [592, 354], [530, 354]]}, {"text": "Line.Whenapesrsoncrossesthedatelinetraveling", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[43, 349], [459, 354], [458, 377], [43, 372]]}, {"text": "east, he subtracts a day, and if he crosses the line", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[44, 372], [459, 376], [458, 401], [44, 396]]}, {"text": "180", "conf": 0.637, "box": [[601, 363], [617, 363], [617, 375], [601, 375]]}, {"text": "traveling west, he adds a day. For example, Kiribati", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[43, 395], [460, 397], [459, 424], [43, 422]]}, {"text": "and Hawai are on different sides of the date line. If we travel from Kiribati to Hawai, we need", "conf": 0.931, "box": [[44, 419], [813, 421], [813, 447], [44, 445]]}, {"text": "to turn the clock back 22 hours, as Hawaii is 22 hoursbehind Kiribati.", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[44, 444], [587, 447], [587, 470], [44, 467]]}, {"text": "GEOnline", "conf": 0.839, "box": [[56, 485], [228, 491], [227, 522], [55, 516]]}, {"text": "Find timeanddate offollowinglocations.", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[58, 528], [363, 533], [363, 554], [58, 549]]}, {"text": "1.Hnolulu Hawaii", "conf": 0.818, "box": [[57, 551], [188, 553], [188, 573], [57, 571]]}, {"text": "ji.Kiritimati,Kiribati", "conf": 0.85, "box": [[276, 554], [436, 556], [435, 577], [276, 575]]}, {"text": "http:/www.timeanddate.com/time/map/", "conf": 0.894, "box": [[58, 575], [381, 581], [381, 601], [58, 596]]}, {"text": "iqilab.com", "conf": 0.792, "box": [[397, 589], [632, 449], [669, 512], [434, 652]]}, {"text": "Calculating time with thehelp of Longitudes", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[46, 609], [418, 614], [417, 637], [46, 632]]}, {"text": "Calculation of Hours", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[47, 633], [206, 637], [206, 657], [47, 653]]}, {"text": "Earth is spherical in shape, there are 360°of longitudes. Earth takes 24Hours to complete one rotation. It", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[45, 653], [819, 660], [819, 687], [45, 679]]}, {"text": "means 360° are covered in 24hours. Therefore, in 1 hour, earth willrotate 15° (360° + 24).", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[45, 677], [711, 686], [710, 712], [45, 704]]}, {"text": "CalculationofMinutes.", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[48, 702], [229, 707], [229, 727], [48, 722]]}, {"text": "Earthcompletesonerotationin=1440minutes(24x60min)", "conf": 0.95, "box": [[47, 724], [513, 731], [513, 751], [47, 744]]}, {"text": "Time difference between any two longitudes is 4minutes (1440 + 360)", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[46, 746], [595, 754], [595, 778], [46, 769]]}, {"text": "Q. Ifit is 12 0'clockin Sialkot (Pakistan) located at 75'E. What would be the time in Riyadh (SaudiArabia)", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[47, 767], [819, 777], [819, 803], [47, 794]]}, {"text": "locatedat46°E.", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[48, 792], [173, 794], [172, 814], [48, 812]]}, {"text": "Solution:Difference of longitudesbetween Sialkotand Riyadh75'E-46'E=29'E.", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[48, 815], [646, 821], [646, 845], [48, 839]]}, {"text": "Weknowthat time difference between any two longitudes is4minutes.", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[48, 835], [570, 846], [570, 869], [48, 858]]}, {"text": "Difference of time between 29°of longitudes= 29° x 4min=116 minutes. (1 hour 56 minutes)", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[48, 858], [743, 869], [742, 892], [48, 882]]}, {"text": "Riyadh is located in west of Pakistan, 1 hours 56 minutes will be subtracted from Sialkot time to find", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[48, 880], [822, 889], [822, 915], [48, 906]]}, {"text": "Riyadhtime.", "conf": 0.86, "box": [[49, 905], [149, 908], [148, 929], [49, 925]]}, {"text": "Sialkottime", "conf": 0.869, "box": [[49, 932], [144, 936], [143, 957], [49, 953]]}, {"text": "=12:00 pm", "conf": 0.802, "box": [[518, 938], [604, 942], [603, 966], [517, 962]]}, {"text": "Difference of time between Sialkot and Riyadh", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[48, 953], [395, 961], [394, 984], [48, 977]]}, {"text": "=-1hour56minutes", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[525, 964], [674, 967], [673, 987], [524, 984]]}, {"text": "Riyadh Time", "conf": 0.862, "box": [[48, 977], [147, 979], [146, 1002], [48, 1000]]}, {"text": "=10:04am", "conf": 0.812, "box": [[519, 985], [604, 988], [603, 1009], [518, 1006]]}, {"text": "Learning Activity", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[62, 1018], [265, 1023], [265, 1050], [62, 1045]]}, {"text": "It is 3:00 pm in Islamabad, which is located at 73°E.Find time of Beijing (China) located at 116°E", "conf": 0.871, "box": [[61, 1057], [698, 1064], [697, 1087], [61, 1080]]}, {"text": "Students will find time difference between Islamabad (Pakistan) and Beijing (China), time difference will be", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[61, 1080], [803, 1088], [803, 1111], [61, 1103]]}, {"text": "added in Islamabadtime to calculate time of Beijing.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[62, 1096], [418, 1101], [417, 1123], [62, 1117]]}, {"text": "38", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[425, 1155], [453, 1155], [453, 1179], [425, 1179]]}, {"text": "Unit 3:Settlementsand Land Use", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[607, 1153], [821, 1155], [821, 1175], [607, 1173]]}]}